{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000122898","bookName":"Conquisté al cuñado de mi mejor amiga","cover":"","viewCount":3574089,"followCount":49293,"introduction":"Sara Guerra no quería separarse de su mejor amiga, Ana Braga, así que decidió conquistar al hermano de su esposo, el doctor Carlos Baro, un hombre frío y reservado. Ella lo persiguió con empeño, mientras él parecía indiferente, aunque a veces la ayudaba. Cuando el primer amor de Carlos reapareció, Sara se cansó y dejó de fingir. Fue entonces cuando Carlos comenzó a perseguirla, hasta que ambos terminaron juntos y enamorados.","chapterCount":80,"labels":["Doctor","Destined Love"],"tags":["Doctor","Destined Love"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Conquisté-al-cuñado-de-mi-mejor-amiga","bookNameLower":"conquisté-al-cuñado-de-mi-mejor-amiga","shelfTime":"2025-10-21 18:45:54","firstShelfTime":"2025-10-21 18:45:54","performerList":[{"performerId":"20480","performerName":"Lejie Ma","performerFormatName":"Lejie-Ma","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x8/20480/20480.jpg?time=1793174917157","videoCount":1}],"performerIdList":[20480]},"chapterList":[{"id":"602443288","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":163529,"price":0},{"id":"602443289","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":128051,"price":0},{"id":"602443290","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":103369,"price":0},{"id":"602443291","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":140126,"price":0},{"id":"602443292","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":102160,"price":0},{"id":"602443293","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":123360,"price":0},{"id":"602443294","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":112371,"price":0},{"id":"602443295","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","